+# Reviewer evidence
+
+`run_logged.sh` records the exact working directory, shell-escaped command,
+exit status, output size, and bounded command output for each dynamic audit
+check. Files in this directory are reviewer-authored; candidate logs and
+compiled definitions are not reused.
